Title: THE GOLDEN HEIST
Credit: written by
Author: Storyboard AI Showcase Team
Draft date: 2026-08-14
Format: Fountain Screenplay Standard

EXT. CASINO MONTE CARLO - NIGHT

Rain lashes against marble balustrades. Neon reflections shimmer across wet limestone.

A black Maserati pulls to the curb. MARCUS (40s, sharp tuxedo, calculating gaze) steps out under an umbrella held by a silent driver.

MARCUS
(adjusting his cufflink)
Check the perimeter cameras. We have forty seconds before the shift change.

ELENA (O.S.)
(through earpiece)
Perimeter is blind. You have thirty-eight seconds now.

INT. CASINO VAULT CORRIDOR - NIGHT

Polished titanium and laser grids. Marcus glides into the frame like a phantom. He presses a cryogenic device to the biometric keypad.

A thin frost blooms across the scanner glass.

MARCUS
Frost is setting. Elena, disable the thermal floor.

ELENA (O.S.)
(whispering)
Disabling grid three... two... now. Move!

Marcus leaps over the deactivated sensors, landing silently before the monolithic vault door.

CUT TO:

INT. INNER VAULT - CONTINUOUS

Inside: rows of illuminated safety deposit boxes gleam in golden amber light. Marcus draws a laser cutter and cuts into Box 777.
